gpui-pre 0.3.10
Upstream: https://github.com/zed-industries/zed (gpui-pre snapshot by https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit)
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE-APACHE is distributed with gpui-pre.

Newport modifies gpui-pre for key events that keep the physical key and the
layout's metadata for terminal input, and the window, popup, text input, file
drop and drag hooks Newport's remote windows use on Windows. The changed files
are src/app/test_context.rs, src/elements/div.rs, src/interactive.rs,
src/key_dispatch.rs, src/platform.rs, src/platform/native_drag.rs,
src/platform/test/window.rs, src/window.rs,
src/window/native_character_tests.rs and tests/physical_key.rs. All other
published package files remain unchanged.
